<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27678" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mălăchē</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏlŏchē</span></b> ,
		ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλάχη</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μολόχη</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a kind of
				mallows</i> (v. malva). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> Form malache, <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, 21, § 103</span></i>
			Müll.; <i><span class="en">Plin. 20, 21, 84, § 222</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">App. Herb.
			41</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Form moloche, <i><span class="en">Col. 10, 247</span></i> (<b>poet.</b>); cf. <i><span class="en">Plin. 20, 4, 14, § 29</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">App. Herb. 41</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
